# Settings -> each submenu. Layout (1400x800): main menu buttons are 200x44 at x=50, y=228+60*i
# (Versus 0, Load game 1, Puzzles 2, Guide 3, Settings 4, Exit 5; Continue is on top when there is an autosave). Settings tabs are 160x44 at y=150, x=440+180*i.
# Piece Theme options are 200x44 at x=50, top y=218+64*i (centre 240+64*i) (Pixel, Medieval, Bauhaus, Neon, Origami, Ink).
wait 20
click 150 490        # Settings
wait 30
capture settings-initial
click 520 172        # Piece Theme tab
wait 20
click 150 240        # Pixel
wait 20
capture settings-piece-theme-pixel
click 150 304        # Medieval
wait 20
capture settings-piece-theme-medieval
click 150 368        # Bauhaus
wait 20
capture settings-piece-theme-bauhaus
click 150 432        # Neon
wait 20
capture settings-piece-theme-neon
click 150 496        # Origami
wait 20
capture settings-piece-theme-origami
click 150 560        # Ink
wait 20
capture settings-piece-theme-ink
click 700 172        # Music tab
wait 20
capture settings-music
click 880 172        # Display tab
wait 20
capture settings-display
